---
import PublicLayout from "../layouts/PublicLayout.astro";
---

<PublicLayout title="Medical Disclaimer" description="Medical disclaimer for Late Diagnosed educational content.">
  <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl text-[#1e2a5e] mb-6">Medical Disclaimer</h1>

    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8">Last updated: June 2026</p>

    <section class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Late Diagnosed provides educational information about neurodivergence, late diagnosis, trauma-related conditions, and related experiences. This information is not a substitute for professional medical, mental health, diagnostic, or therapeutic care.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">No Medical Services</h2>
      <p>
        Late Diagnosed does not provide medical services, mental health services, therapy, diagnosis, treatment, medication guidance, crisis intervention, or individualized clinical recommendations.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Not Medical Advice</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on this website should be interpreted as medical advice, diagnosis, treatment, or a recommendation to begin, stop, or change any medical or mental health care.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Seek Qualified Support</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about your health, mental health, diagnosis, symptoms, medications, treatment, or safety, please consult a qualified healthcare professional.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Emergency Situations</h2>
      <p>
        If you believe you may be in immediate danger or experiencing a medical or mental health emergency, call emergency services or go to the nearest emergency department.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">No Professional Relationship</h2>
      <p>
        Use of this website does not create a medical, mental health, therapeutic, or professional service relationship between you and Late Diagnosed.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">No Liability</h2>
      <p>
        Late Diagnosed is not liable for decisions, actions, outcomes, damages, or losses that may result from use of or reliance on educational information provided on this website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Lived Experience and Education</h2>
      <p>
        Some Late Diagnosed content may discuss lived experience, community perspectives, or educational interpretations of research. These materials are intended to support understanding and conversation, not to replace individualized care.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this disclaimer may be sent to <a class="text-[#1e2a5e] underline" href="mailto:info@latediagnosed.org">info@latediagnosed.org</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</PublicLayout>
